# Trivy vulnerability allowlist for ourdao-backend container image.
#
# POLICY:
# Every ignored CVE must:
# 1. Have a clear rationale explaining why it is an acceptable risk or a false positive.
# 2. Link to an upstream tracking issue or advisory.
# 3. Specify an expiration date (format: exp:YYYY-MM-DD) after which it must be re-evaluated.
#
# Example:
# # CVE-2026-XXXX: Busybox unaligned read, not reachable via node runtime. Tracking: #000
# # CVE-2026-XXXX exp:2026-12-31
